{"title":"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The regular price for a T-shirt is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfbe8755ab50447cac8dac1ef464e9d4034f110d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and the regular price for a pair of jeans is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/0/610749c9007e75a2c3ade0209fdcc2b16264876b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" />. If the T-shirt is sold at a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/e/32e5939a7bdd847ec86582225cd653c240b4abce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> discount and the jeans are sold at a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> discount, then the total discount is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/2/e523cb1cc7db579e420418d4b43089cf86d93945.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\$15 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\$20 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\$30 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\$36 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"479\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can find each discount and then add them together.\n</p><p>The discount for the T-shirt would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9cf0b9978ed903f82d6b73b36b6b25b647a91a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$25 \\times 30\\% = \\$25 \\times \\frac{3}{10} = \\$7.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"246\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>The discount for the T-shirt would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/4/a24dd2ce36e45ba0a79cd4f376e7070b502962f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$75 \\times 10\\% = \\$75 \\times \\frac{1}{10} = \\$7.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"246\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Adding these, we can see that the total discount is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/5/08520e12e3a8b211a95dcfc767824cdb836463e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$7.50 + \\$7.50 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } \\$15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"205\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat\">2006 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/